    <briefdescription>
<para>Phase D CPU baseline benchmarks for GPU break-even Category B kernels. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Category B covers graph and geospatial kernels that require &gt;= 1.3x GPU speedup before GPU execution is allowed. This benchmark records reproducible CPU-only baselines so later GPU hardware runs can compare against a fixed host reference. </para>
